merge mechanics lesson (add to prompt_tl): a squash merge of a branch whose PR
is still a draft is refused ("Pull Request is still a draft") and one whose PR
was rebased while main moved reports "merge conflicts" even when the squash is
clean. Both happened. Rule: `gh pr ready <n>` before merging, and when the
squash is already on main, close the PR with the squash SHA instead of
re-merging.

